<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-13T00:53:25.656Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:53:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli drones hit a Syrian operative planning attacks for Iran near the Lebanon border and wounded six people in Lebanon, while Houthi forces struck Riyadh's King Khalid Airport, killing 12 and injuring 309, prompting a phone call between Syrian and Saudi foreign ministers on regional security. Syrian security forces stepped up anti-ISIS operations, pursued former regime loyalists, and clashed with private security firms linked to a new Syrian security mogul, while also foiling drug-smuggling attempts on the Iraq and Jordan borders. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9OdTl5Y3Z0ZktMb3VsS284M3dDNldMNzdtRlc5NTNEczkzbXJOdEFWTVdWQkJsRkpCWWI5bk12WHFkMFcyYmhnMkV0YjV0ekhweWp6eTNpMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNOUxtOGlTYm5RR19ZamNJSW9mLWhrTVdDRVJpb3FSemdyMlc3eXZqcFZsTHBvRFBGT3BvUzh6dTBlNTlvblhVMU44WlA3RUxqcVZzSTFOcFZfVXd1Wk9VSTdkaFRWdGJFOXdpZzdVeFR3WGlaZ1UxSENhLW53V3B3ZUJfdG9Udm83bHNzbXdsS3owcVVaSkdUeExDUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQanlIc1NWNTBGSkZyZWpLbGhMbnc2SzBJWmhtZmtZVEJMdHdZT1ZqU3czZ0JBbWFLS1M5X3VOMDl1b1k3UThUNGxlMExzZ3QzeEdySXYwWWZjTU5jeExTLWExYlQ0cE5NRzdVM1F4eXczdXg3X1d0Y0haUVI3TUc3U3NCMVVwMHdMbmw5ODhYV3JwcDczT0J6Q1JwZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOVlpFRnNJS2Z5UVVBR0lKdDFKSTRvTm9jQXJtOFVRZm8tMVF0Y2hqT2VRNmNpd0QwZEhnMExPV0pzNGc0d3p0RHc5NzdrRVNaay1CdEt